    10| *
    11| *   This module persists each store's JSON state into Supabase Postgres (the same
    12| *   database the public chat already uses durably), keyed by the store's file path.
    13| *   Data now survives restarts, deploys, and tier changes regardless of disk.
    14| *
    15| * Design:
    16| *   - One table `ivx_durable_documents(doc_key text pk, value jsonb, updated_at)`
    17| *     holds the materialised state for each store (one row per JSON file).
    18| *   - One table `ivx_durable_events(id bigserial, doc_key, event jsonb, created_at)`
    19| *     holds the append-only forensic event log (replaces the *.jsonl files).
    20| *   - Schema is created lazily and idempotently via the existing `ivx_exec_sql` RPC.
